    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Stokes and quirke are delighted to bring to the market this spacious 3 bedroom semi detached home in very good decorative order throughout with the added benefit of a large landscaped rear garden. Constructed in 2005 and extending to c. 84 sq.m., the accommodation includes an entrance hall, guest w.c., sitting room with bay window, large kitchen/diner with sliding door to rear garden. Upstairs there are 3 spacious bedrooms (master ensuite) and bathroom. The property has PVC windows and oil fired central heating giving the home a desirable C BER rating. Located in an excellent village centre location, this fine home overlooks the large green and the Community Playschool is nearby. Early viewing is recommended. \r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n1.90m x 4.35m Tiled flooring with carpet staircase and under stairs W.C.\r\n\r\nWC\r\n0.75m x 1.65m Tiled flooring, W.C, W.H.B\r\n\r\nSitting Room\r\n3.70m x 4.50m Timber flooring with a cast iron fireplace and timber surround. Ample light provided by the bay window overlooking the front.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\n3.10m x 5.75m Tiled flooring with units at eye and floor level along with a window and sliding door to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n2.25m x 2.20m Carpet flooring with the hot press thereof\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.80m x 1.90m Tiled flooring W.C, W.H.B, bath and shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.75m x 3.60m Carpet flooring, window overlooking the rear garden and a En-Suite thereof.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n0.75m x 1.60m Tiled flooring, W.C, W.H.B and electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.95m x 4.35m Tiled flooring and a window overlooking the front garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.70m x 2.70m Tiled flooring and a window overlooking the front garden.\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nLovely secure south facing rear garden with timber shed"
      },
